   =Value:I'm so glad I found someone to play guitar with! \nKeep on rockin' {0}\n - {1}
   =DoNotTranslate:True
  i240
   =GUID:6239302413423786122
   =Key:Letter_Letter_JustBecameDanceBuddy
   =Value:Hey {0}! \nHope you'll want to dance with me some more in the future! \nYours groovy, {1}
   =DoNotTranslate:True
  i239
   =GUID:5758164258370033864
   =Key:Letter_Letter_JustBecamePianoBuddy
   =Value:Hope we'll play piano together sometime! \n Keep practising your arpeggios, {0} - Pianistically yours, {1}
   =DoNotTranslate:True
  i241
   =GUID:2615541627434295286
   =Key:Letter_Letter_JustBecameExercisingBuddy
   =Value:You're the real MVP, {0}! \nGlad I could flex those muscles with you.\n See you at the gym! {1}
   =DoNotTranslate:True
  i242
   =GUID:9020404315505605991
   =Key:Letter_Letter_JustBecameProgrammingBuddy
   =Value:Hello World, I mean {0},\n't was great crushing these bugs together.\nSee you soon! {1}
   =DoNotTranslate:True
  i243
   =GUID:1495213240875322712
   =Key:Letter_Letter_JustBecameGraphicDesignBuddy
   =Value:Didn't know you were an artist, {0}!\nGraphic design is our common passion, I see.\nSee you soon| - {1}
   =DoNotTranslate:True
