   =GUID:9096916374001314356
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Overjoyed
   =Value:Overjoyed Parafolks get happy easily and like to spread joy around.\n\nThey thrive the most when they are happy.
   =OriginalValue:Overjoyed Parafolks get happy easily and like to spread joy around.\n\nThey thrive the most when they are happy.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2567
   =GUID:2911009745554760959
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Serious
   =Value:Serious Parafolks are ambitious and goal-oriented.\n\nThey thrive the most when they are achieving great things.
   =OriginalValue:Serious Parafolks are ambitious and goal-oriented.\n\nThey thrive the most when they are achieving great things.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2568
   =GUID:8666794897242028856
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Grumpy
   =Value:Grumpy Parafolks are short-tempered and get mad easily.\n\nThey thrive the most when they have a lot of things to grump about.
   =OriginalValue:Grumpy Parafolks are short-tempered and get mad easily.\n\nThey thrive the most when they have a lot of things to grump about.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2569
   =GUID:2081948952068750564
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Gloomy
   =Value:Gloomy Parafolks get sad easily, but they choose to embrace it.\n\nThey thrive the most when they are sad.
   =OriginalValue:Gloomy Parafolks get sad easily, but they choose to embrace it.\n\nThey thrive the most when they are sad.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2570
   =GUID:3633492287906250219
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Energetic
   =Value:Energetic Parafolks are very active and often have an energy surplus that allows them to do more with their day.\n\nThey thrive the most when they can use this extra energy.
   =OriginalValue:Energetic Parafolks are very active and often have an energy surplus that allows them to do more with their day.\n\nThey thrive the most when they spend this extra energy.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2571
   =GUID:8673500924326667059
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Peaceful
   =Value:Peaceful Parafolks are calm and prefer to focus on their inner peace.\n\nThey thrive the most when taking the time to reflect and putting their accumulated inner peace to good use.
   =OriginalValue:Peaceful Parafolks are calm and focus on their inner peace.\n\nThey thrive the most when taking time to reflect and putting their accumulated inner peace to good use.
   =DoNotTranslate:True
   =LocalizationState:132
  i2572
   =GUID:1681587064510321725
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Sensitive
   =Value:Sensitive Parafolks are empathic and feel their emotions more intensely.\n\nThey thrive the most when they can leverage their emotions to achieve their goals.
   =OriginalValue:Sensitive Parafolks are empathic and feel every emotion more intensely.\n\nThey thrive the most when they can leverage their emotions to complete their goals.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2573
   =GUID:5237154496884887069
   =Key:TraitDescription_Vibe_Jester
   =Value:Jester Parafolks are good at making fun of everything and are always full of surprises.\n\nThey thrive the most when they can make people laugh and follow their whimsy.
   =OriginalValue:Jester Parafolks are good at making fun of everything and are always full of surprises.\n\nThey thrive the most when they make people laugh and follow their whimsy.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2574
   =GUID:2148681770198001350
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_Music
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent excel with musical instruments; piano, guitar, and even the triangle are no feat for them.\n\nThey have special abilities that trigger when playing music.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent excel with any instrument: piano, guitar, even the triangle is no feat for them.\n\nThey have special abilities that trigger when playing music.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2575
   =GUID:2920742733450279430
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_Technology
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent love computers, and skills like programming are easy for them.\n\nThey have abilities linked to their computer usage.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent love computers, and skills like programming are easy for them.\n\nThey have abilities linked to their computer usage.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2576
   =GUID:5145499275466599993
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_VisualArts
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent excel at painting and express themselves via visual art.\n\nThey are at their happiest creating art, and their paintings sell for more than those of Paras without the art talent.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent excel at painting and express themselves via this medium.\n\nThey are at their happiest creating art, and their paintings sell for more.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2577
   =GUID:5915641778261050870
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_Food
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent love eating and cooking, and know their way around a spice rack.\n\nThey start off knowing more recipes than other Paras, and their food gives special effects to those who eat it.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent love eating and cooking, and know their way around a spice rack.\n\nThey start off knowing more recipes than other Paras, and their food gives special effects.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2578
   =GUID:3693406745035043837
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_Fitness
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent love to move, and are the happiest at their sweatiest.\n\nThey get happy when they exercise, and their Hygiene need drains slower.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent love to move, and are the happiest at their sweatiest.\n\nThey get happy when they exercise, and their hygiene need decays slower.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2579
   =GUID:1508270947047835677
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_JackOfAllTrade
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent perform well in all skills and want to learn as many things as possible.\n\nThey get bonuses when they work on all their skills.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent perform well in all skills and desire to learn as many things as possible.\n\nThey get bonuses when all their skills are worked on.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2580
   =GUID:1803066589787847840
   =Key:TraitDescription_Talent_GoodAtNothing
   =Value:Parafolks with this talent are good at nothing: not everyone can be talented.\n\nTheir skills progress slowly, they fail tasks more often, and they get sick easily.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this talent are good at nothing: not everyone can be talented.\n\nTheir skills progress slowly, they fail tasks more often, and get sick easily.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2581
   =GUID:3568027650154763373
   =Key:TraitDescription_Social_BeingAlone
   =Value:Parafolks with this social perk prefer to spend time alone rather than with others.\n\nBeing alone gives them significant bonuses.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this trait prefer to spend time alone rather than with a group.\n\nBeing alone gives them powerful bonuses.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2582
   =GUID:2857119030426675960
   =Key:TraitDescription_Social_MakingFriends
   =Value:Parafolks with this social perk like the company of others.\n\nThey make friends very easily.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this trait like the company of others.\n\nThey make friends more easily than others.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2583
   =GUID:7951861799120837743
   =Key:TraitDescription_Social_TakingCare
   =Value:Parafolks with this social perk put others first and are always there to help.\n\nThey can relieve other Paras' needs and bad emotions.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this trait always put others first and are always there to help.\n\nThey can relieve the need and bad emotions of other Paras.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2584
   =GUID:5644310527703832434
   =Key:TraitDescription_Social_Romance
   =Value:Parafolks with this social perk love having some romance in their lives.\n\nThey have more success with flirting and get more interesting flirting prompts.
   =OriginalValue:Parafolks with this trait love having some romance in their life.\n\nThey have more success with flirting and get more interesting flirting prompts.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i2585
   =GUID:8446309943164112254
