   =Key:Interaction_TalkWithBabyInArms
   =Value:Talk to baby
   =OriginalValue:Talk to baby
   =LocalizationState:140
   =InfoForTranslators
  i3174
   =GUID:7092902076205361089
   =Key:Interaction_TalkWithBabyOnFloor
   =Value:Talk to baby
   =OriginalValue:Talk to baby
   =LocalizationState:136
  i3175
   =GUID:6510038022669462137
   =Key:NeedDescription_Alternate_BabyHunger
   =Value:You can breastfeed your baby, or you can have a teen-or-older Parafolk take care of your baby by bottle-feeding them.
   =OriginalValue:You can breastfeed your baby, or you will need a teen-or-older Parafolk to take care of your baby by bottlefeeding them.
   =LocalizationState:136
  i3176
   =GUID:1253013606137760789
   =Key:NeedDescription_Alternate_ToddlerHunger
   =Value:Toddlers can grab food by themselves, but the best way to feed them is for a teen-or-older Parafolk to place them in a high chair.
   =OriginalValue:Toddlers can grab food by themselves, but the best way to feed them is for a teen-or-older Parafolk to place them in their high chair.
   =LocalizationState:136
  i3177
   =GUID:3095051889240071862
   =Key:NeedDescription_Alternate_BabyToddlerBathroom
   =Value:Babies and toddlers will automatically go in their diapers when their Bathroom need gets too low. They really don't mind! Alternatively, toddlers can use the potty.
   =OriginalValue:Babies and toddlers will go automatically in their diapers when their bathroom need gets too low. They really don't mind it! Alternatively toddlers can use the potty.
   =LocalizationState:140
  i3178
   =GUID:5815286998513174854
   =Key:NeedDescription_Alternate_ToddlerHygiene
   =Value:Babies and toddlers get dirty if they go in their diapers, but they also slowly get dirty over time. They can't wash themselves, so they need a teen-or-older Parafolk to clean them up!
   =OriginalValue:Babies and toddlers get dirty if they go in their diapers, but they'll also slowly get dirty over time. They can wash themselves, so they'll need a teen-or-older Parafolk to give them a good clean!
   =LocalizationState:140
  i3179
   =GUID:5872602821581046540
   =Key:NeedDescription_Alternate_BabySleep
   =Value:Babies get tired pretty quickly and they'll be cranky if a teen-or-older Parafolk doesn't put them in their crib!
   =OriginalValue:Babies get tired pretty quick and they'll be cranky if a teen-or-older Parafolk does not put them in their baby bed!
   =LocalizationState:136
