  i7565
   =GUID:487917317995391506
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Stark
   =Value:Samantha has worked her way to the absolute top! She prides herself on engaging her employees through team building activities and curating a positive workplace environment. So when her greatest rival, Julien, threatens all of her accomplishments as well as those of her team, she simply must take action!
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Samantha Stark  is a female Young Adult
  i7566
   =GUID:2568842644011077516
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Strong
   =Value:Tyrie is not only artistically brilliant, but also loves to share her gifts with her community, prioritizing values such as love, acceptance, equality, and sustainability. Through her art and music, she promotes individuality and freedom of expression. Her main goal is to fight for what's right, and to uplift positive voices in the community.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Tyrie Strong is a female Young Adult
  i7567
   =GUID:2498111775082639899
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Barnes
   =Value:Kareem loves all things cozy and comforting. He enjoys the simple things in life: rainy days, black coffee, and a good book. He spends his time escaping into stories, as the trials of day-to-day life are a little overwhelming for him at times. Maybe he'd like someone to share his stories with?
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Kareem Barnes is a male Young Adult
  i7568
   =GUID:6828366114912791564
   =Key:HouseholdBio_OReilly
   =Value:Florence and Faye have been happily married for 30 years! They've been together through thick and thin, supporting each other and holding hands through the best and worst of times. Both now retired, Florence can focus on her garden, and Faye can relax and listen to her favorite vinyl records. Every morning, they enjoy reminiscing about beautiful memories created over a lifetime. They both relish every single day knowing soulmates exist, waiting for the next life where they'll be sure to find each other again.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Florence O'Reilly and Faye Orozco are a couple of female Elder
   =OriginalValue
  i7569
   =GUID:8712207051291003306
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Preston
   =Value:The Preston-Beaumonts are the perfect family... or at least they seem to be. Peeking behind the white picket fence will reveal Pauline's rigidity, Gerard's struggle with his work-life balance, and Zoe trying her best to figure herself out alongside her baby brother Adrien.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Pauline Beaumont is a female Adult, Gerard Preston is a male adult, their children are Zoé Preston-Beaumont a female teenager and Adrien Preston-Beaumont a male toddler.
  i7570
   =GUID:2315985330573019779
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Reed
   =Value:If charisma had a name, it'd be Lian Reed! He knows exactly how to charm and schmooze his way into getting what he wants. It's essentially his greatest quality, but maybe it's even... his greatest flaw?
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Lian Reed is a male Young Adult
  i7571
   =GUID:5399648846515699458
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Wolf
   =Value:Celebrating something? You absolutely want to invite Rebecca, Bianca, and Monica! They're not only the life of the party, they ARE the party. However, life has a way of reminding us all of a simple fact: we all have to grow up at some point. Will these three friends be able to handle the ups and downs of careers, bills, and maybe even family life, all while continuing to uphold their status as partying legends?
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Rebecca Wolf, Bianca Shah and Monica Aoki are all 3 female young adult
  i7572
   =GUID:909740289237761521
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Darcier
   =Value:Solene loves cupcakes, romance movies, and frolicking through fields in her best sundress. Kian loves spicy chicken wings, restoring his old motorcycle, and moshing at heavy metal concerts. Together? Well, it turns out that cute pink dresses look GREAT in a mosh pit, as does black icing on cupcakes. What more can these two opposites learn from each other?
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Solene Darcier is a female Young Adult in a relationship with Kian Cross a male Young Adult
  i7573
   =GUID:3260248254677934317
