   =GUID:733013575944242960
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_Requests
   =Value:Requests
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7656
   =GUID:2922982444290285939
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_AgingAndDeath
   =Value:Aging and Death
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7657
   =GUID:6239000633898219916
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships
   =Value:Relationships
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7658
   =GUID:2184694956676210951
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together
   =Value:Spending Time Together
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7659
   =GUID:1530214019408708181
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards
   =Value:Together Cards
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7660
   =GUID:2550217446761169044
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_RelationshipLabels
   =Value:Relationship Labels
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7661
   =GUID:5928056646412295851
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations
   =Value:Occupations
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7662
   =GUID:7693605896452878235
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work
   =Value:Work
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7663
   =GUID:1010479299724998615
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School
   =Value:School
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7664
   =GUID:5718335135084986723
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Daycare
   =Value:Daycare
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7665
   =GUID:8368081341429244444
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills
   =Value:Skills
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7666
   =GUID:5790809884406529216
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers
   =Value:Babies and Toddlers
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7667
   =GUID:5777706610555072324
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_TryingForBaby
   =Value:Trying for a Baby
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7668
   =GUID:6085167532594763257
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_Pregnancy
   =Value:Pregnancy
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7669
   =GUID:8152291441183931281
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds
   =Value:Baby Needs
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7670
   =GUID:4674420246770583037
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds
   =Value:Toddler Needs
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7671
   =GUID:8122852623910958941
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Bills
   =Value:Bank Statements
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7672
   =GUID:2423498707472218667
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers1
   =Value:In Paralives, you can pick a <link=0>Storyteller</link> to accompany your Parafolks while they live their <link=1>stories</link>. Each Storyteller affects gameplay elements in different ways.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7673
   =GUID:922957257131585788
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_PickingStoryteller
   =Value:Picking a Storyteller
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7674
   =GUID:8451939219488987022
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_CustomStorytellers
   =Value:Custom Storytellers
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7675
   =GUID:5316978314671369154
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_StoryCards
   =Value:Story Cards
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7676
   =GUID:3962179056257807147
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds
   =Value:Managing Households
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7677
   =GUID:3071432370549182847
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Body
   =Value:Body and Face
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7678
   =GUID:1939380952239848542
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Outfit
   =Value:Outfits
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7679
   =GUID:7087733211194366963
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality
   =Value:Personality
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7680
   =GUID:2169465177476211613
   =Key:Help_Support
   =Value:Support
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7681
   =GUID:537902857560112000
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Personality1
   =Value:When creating a household in the Paramaker, different aspects of each Parafolk's <link=0>personality</link> can be selected. Their personality impacts their <link=1>emotions</link>, <link=2>wants</link>, <link=3>needs</link>, <link=4>life goals</link>, and <link=5>Together Cards</link>.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7682
   =GUID:41455956497475258
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Personality2
   =Value:Upgrading Personalities
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7683
   =GUID:886284376468065761
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Personality3
   =Value:Parafolks gain personality points by completing <link=0>wants</link> and <link=1>life goals</link>. When they have enough points, their personality levels up, allowing you to upgrade an aspect of it.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7684
   =GUID:6341040758997859262
   =Key:Help_LiveMode1
   =Value:After <link=0>creating some Parafolks</link> and <link=1>building their house</link>, Live Mode is where the life simulation takes place, allowing you to manage and watch your Parafolks as their lives unfold.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7685
   =GUID:3483296561551828198
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs1
   =Value:Parafolks have needs that must be taken care of. If neglected, they'll be in a bad mood, which affects their <link=0>job performance</link>, <link=1>Together Cards</link>, and <link=2>skill</link> learning speed.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7686
   =GUID:2597268287656006235
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Hunger1
   =Value:To relieve their Hunger need, Parafolks can use the fridge to eat snacks or cook recipes.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7687
   =GUID:1252342916850907971
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Hunger2
   =Value:More recipes can be learned on the computer, through <link=0>Together Cards</link>, or by leveling up the cooking skill. Higher-level recipes have a higher chance of failing and producing spoiled food.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7688
   =GUID:7273000680079274418
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Hunger3
   =Value:While away <link=0>at work or at school</link>, a Para's Hunger need will automatically be relieved during lunch hours.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7689
   =GUID:8875109567927094254
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Hunger4
   =Value:Parafolks can die if their Hunger bar is empty for too long.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7690
   =GUID:5595782855085972816
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Bathroom1
   =Value:To relieve their Bathroom need, Parafolks can use the toilet. While away <link=0>at work or at school</link>, the need will automatically be relieved.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7691
   =GUID:7806134398683385995
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Sleep1
   =Value:To relieve the Sleep need, Parafolks can use a bed to sleep. Going to sleep resets whatever <link=0>wants</link> the Parafolk had before sleeping.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7692
   =GUID:2292190294937828588
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Sleep2
   =Value:Parafolks can die if their Sleep need is empty for too long.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7693
   =GUID:1587547603792567768
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Needs_Hygiene1
   =Value:To relieve their Hygiene need, Parafolks can shower or bathe. Washing their hands or brushing their teeth will also relieve the need by a small amount.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7694
   =GUID:4514214347410703068
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Emotions1
   =Value:Parafolks go through different emotions based on their successes, their failures, and how their day unfolds in general.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7695
   =GUID:1347038863945846939
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Emotions2
   =Value:Each emotion has a number indicating the current strength of said emotion. Hovering your mouse over an emotion shows the emotional reasons why the Para has the emotion, as well as how much time it will take for those emotional reasons to no longer influence it.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7696
   =GUID:7420546819708385234
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Emotions3
   =Value:Emotions can give bonuses to <link=0>job performance</link> and <link=1>skill</link> learning speed, as well as unlock <link=2>Together Cards</link>. Some <link=3>personality traits</link> also leverage certain emotions to get even more bonuses from them. For instance, Overjoyed Parafolks learn skills faster when happy, while Gloomy Parafolks learn skills faster when sad.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7697
   =GUID:8578814609891041567
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Wants1
   =Value:Wants are short-term objectives that Parafolks can have. Parafolks can get new wants in reaction to various <link=0>emotions</link> they have.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7698
   =GUID:7034990198490505726
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Wants2
   =Value:Click on the relevant emotion to select a new want.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7699
   =GUID:7395696075601005487
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Wants3
   =Value:Wants always reset when going to sleep, but one of them can be pinned and saved for the next day:
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7700
   =GUID:8740955923855271311
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Wants4
   =Value:One want can be pinned at a time, and wants can also be deleted if you wish to make room for new ones.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7701
   =GUID:588164132771588738
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Wants5
   =Value:Completing a want gives your Parafolks personality experience points, which can be used <link=0>to upgrade their personalities</link>.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7702
   =GUID:7359858453159318471
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals1
   =Value:While <link=0>wants</link> are short-term objectives, Parafolks can also obtain long-term goals.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7703
   =GUID:7224384495155139942
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals2
   =Value:To see a given Parafolk's list of goals, open the Goal panel.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7704
   =GUID:6100793144936616530
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals3
   =Value:A goal can be tracked so that it always remains visible while playing in Live Mode. Goals can also be removed if you no longer want to complete them.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7705
   =GUID:6614321707362934918
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_LifeGoals1
   =Value:Life goals are long-term objectives that Parafolks can have.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7706
   =GUID:7703339183581219213
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_LifeGoals2
   =Value:New life goals can be randomly obtained from time to time through <link=0>Story Cards</link>.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7707
   =GUID:7777715456527354472
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_LifeGoals3
   =Value:Your Parafolk's <link=0>personality</link> and previously completed life goals affect what future life goals will be offered.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7708
   =GUID:8841015525176559661
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_LifeGoals4
   =Value:Completing a life goal gives personality points, which can be used to <link=0>upgrade a Parafolk's personality</link>.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7709
   =GUID:1506644750544130352
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_Requests1
   =Value:Requests are long-term objectives given by Townies. Townies have new requests every day.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7710
   =GUID:4177225198355318415
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_Requests2
   =Value:Requests can be obtained by checking the town's request boards or by talking to a Townie who has a “!” above their head.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7711
   =GUID:4039699613255616050
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_Requests3
   =Value:Once you've completed a request, you can claim your reward by using the appropriate <link=0>Together Card</link> with the Townie who made the request.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7712
   =GUID:5668255528819717776
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_AgingAndDeath1
   =Value:Parafolks grow old and eventually pass away. Make the most of their time and prepare for the next generation.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7713
   =GUID:3695474042567620167
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_AgingAndDeath2
   =Value:Their current life stage and the time remaining before the next one can be seen in the Profile panel.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7714
   =GUID:1893422488887467591
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_AgingAndDeath3
   =Value:Customize your <link=0>Storyteller</link> to disable aging or change the duration of life stages.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7715
   =GUID:3757200069910259774
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together1
   =Value:Forming a Group
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7716
   =GUID:313821347465563769
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together2
   =Value:Groups of Parafolks can be formed in many ways, listed below. When in a group, you can then pick <link=0>Together Cards</link> to make the conversation evolve.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7717
   =GUID:402639286135625643
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together3
   =Value:Clicking on a Parafolk and selecting the “Talk” interaction will automatically form a group.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7718
   =GUID:1553659474382563970
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together4
   =Value:To do something as a group, first draw a selection rectangle by clicking the left mouse button and dragging the cursor to select all Parafolks in a given zone.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7719
   =GUID:134900233083136746
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together5
   =Value:Alternatively, hold the Shift key and then left-click Parafolks in the interface to select them and form a group. Parafolks in the world can be right-clicked to be selected, and holding the Shift key will allow you to select multiple Parafolks.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7720
   =GUID:6290954215823469973
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together6
   =Value:Group Dynamics
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7721
   =GUID:3582250897113939418
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together7
   =Value:While a group is formed, interactions are marked as such in the interaction queue. As long as you stay in the group, interactions will be synced and done by the whole group.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7722
   =GUID:7109699514778548232
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together8
   =Value:Disbanding a Group
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7723
   =GUID:6691970976978532805
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together9
   =Value:To get a Para to leave a group, cancel their current group interaction or click the “Leave” button in the mouseover panel.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7724
   =GUID:2572941736390588176
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_Together10
   =Value:Parafolks will sometimes leave a group autonomously. This can happen if the Para needs to go to work, is very bored, too hungry, etc.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7725
   =GUID:4349523444748406359
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards1
   =Value:While in a group, Parafolks can talk together or do any interactions they can do solo, such as taking care of their needs, working on their skills, and so on.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7726
   =GUID:8058415678111838786
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards2
   =Value:Together Bar
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7727
   =GUID:7022178952132092738
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards3
   =Value:As long as Parafolks stay in a group, their Together Bar will increase, no matter what they do together. When the bar is filled, the “!” button can be clicked to select a new Together Card.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7728
   =GUID:9196616076290003489
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards4
   =Value:Together Cards
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7729
   =GUID:186537340843117735
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards5
   =Value:Together Cards let you select a development for the conversation that a group of Paras is having.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7730
   =GUID:1170896696964058070
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards6
   =Value:Parafolks can explore different ways to develop their relationships, whether that includes making jokes, being mean, flirting, and more.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7731
   =GUID:5516021569184486972
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_TogetherCards7
   =Value:Every card will change the emotions of each Parafolk differently, which can influence the next Together Cards offered once the Together Bar is filled up again.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7732
   =GUID:2232434575192977719
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_RelationshipLabels1
   =Value:When in a group, depending on the emotions of the individual Parafolks, the <link=0>Storyteller</link> will sometimes offer a special <link=1>Together Card</link> that makes their relationship evolve through a new Relationship Label.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7733
   =GUID:5516063599539134567
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_RelationshipLabels2
   =Value:Because these Parafolks made jokes together and have the Amused emotion, the <link=0>Storyteller</link> offers the opportunity for them to become friends.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7734
   =GUID:2005836252052951278
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships_RelationshipLabels3
   =Value:Unlocking Relationship Labels and leveling them up will unlock new interactions and <link=0>Together Cards</link> for when those Parafolks spend time together.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7735
   =GUID:757051282047354039
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work1
   =Value:Working is the most common way for Parafolks to earn money. When a Para has a job, they automatically commute to and from work based on their job's schedule. Parafolks cannot be controlled while they are at work.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7736
   =GUID:3502110416152572489
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work2
   =Value:Finding a Job
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7737
   =GUID:4780578127492818359
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work3
   =Value:To find work, Parafolks can use the computer, the phone, or find job posters at workplaces around town.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7738
   =GUID:3391905399104137222
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work4
   =Value:Available positions change every day.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7739
   =GUID:7564423056030384788
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work5
   =Value:Job positions have different requirements, expressed in the form of points. Mouse over a position to see where your Parafolk stands and what they need to improve to be able to get a specific job.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7740
   =GUID:591408696826854837
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work6
   =Value:This Parafolk needs to increase their skills in cooking or gain more work experience in the field to be able to get this position.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7741
   =GUID:4628632722982085010
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work7
   =Value:Climbing the Career Ladder
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7742
   =GUID:8751825585532555332
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work8
   =Value:After each day of work, your Parafolk will earn their salary and have the chance to get a job upgrade point. The likelihood of this happening is equal to the percentage value indicated by the job performance meter.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7743
   =GUID:3674964163403914342
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work9
   =Value:Job performance can be improved by going to work with positive <link=0>emotions</link> and by continuing to work on the skills required for the job.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7744
   =GUID:2797488712253784959
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work10
   =Value:You can spend upgrade points to increase your Parafolk's rank in their job, giving them a small boost in salary, or to unlock unique perks.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7745
   =GUID:3770913732256281454
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work11
   =Value:A Parafolk can only have a certain number of perks at a time, meaning that a previous perk may need to be removed to make room for a new, better one.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7746
   =GUID:844182616663326132
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work14
   =Value:Parafolks can have more than one job as long as their schedules don't conflict. When accepting a new job, you can choose the job's schedule. Different jobs have different days and hours offered.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7747
   =GUID:3482891763486472363
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work12
   =Value:Work Schedule
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7748
   =GUID:8034749580897481604
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work15
   =Value:To change the schedule of an existing job, click the “Change Schedule” button at the bottom of the occupation panel.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7749
   =GUID:2039398188244371539
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work16
   =Value:Quitting a Job
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7750
   =GUID:3527079465542046706
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Work17
   =Value:To quit a job, click the “Quit Job” button at the bottom of the occupation panel.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7751
   =GUID:2304568984894746492
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School1
   =Value:Parafolks in the child and pre-teen life stages are automatically enrolled in elementary school, while those in the teen life stage are in high school. Students will automatically go to school Monday through Friday. They cannot be controlled when at school.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7752
   =GUID:3261980253847872271
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School3
   =Value:Like jobs, Parafolks attending school can unlock occupation perks, and they can also improve their grades in school subjects. This is done through upgrade points earned at the end of each school day.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7753
   =GUID:7518475103733070700
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School2
   =Value:Grades
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7754
   =GUID:4529659989398360945
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School4
   =Value:The likelihood of getting an upgrade point each day is equal to the percentage value indicated by the school performance meter. Parafolks heading to school with positive <link=0>emotions</link> will do better in school.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7755
   =GUID:173845925360506816
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School5
   =Value:Homework
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7756
   =GUID:1355300876855596234
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School6
   =Value:After a school day, Parafolks will sometimes have homework to do.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7757
   =GUID:8189055609290571334
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_School7
   =Value:A computer can be used to complete homework, which will improve the grade of the corresponding school subject.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7758
   =GUID:5471303151459035602
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Daycare1
   =Value:Baby and toddler Parafolks automatically go to daycare when no teen-or-older Parafolks are with them at home. When an older Para does come back, babies and toddlers will automatically come back from daycare.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7759
   =GUID:6131304367644933401
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations_Daycare2
   =Value:Weekly <link=0>bank statements</link> will list daycare costs, which will be higher the more time they spend there.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7760
   =GUID:7070079414965970451
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills1
   =Value:By working on their skills, Parafolks can progress and level them up, unlocking new interactions and helping them perform better at <link=0>work</link>.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7761
   =GUID:4932999930521664882
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills2
   =Value:Mouse over a skill in progress to see how fast your Parafolk is currently learning. This speed will change depending on your Para's <link=0>emotions</link>, <link=1>personality traits</link>, and more.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7762
   =GUID:127930824249291632
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills3
   =Value:The maximum skill level is 20.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7763
   =GUID:2302366700052337677
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills4
   =Value:Knowledge Skills
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7764
   =GUID:6532363968723814005
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills5
   =Value:Skills fall under general skills that are called knowledge skills.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7765
   =GUID:932074709016146979
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills6
   =Value:For example, working on the guitar skill will also slowly make your Para progress in the music knowledge skill. The Para will be able to learn other instruments like the piano faster because of their music knowledge.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7766
   =GUID:1645554295485489130
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Skills7
   =Value:Knowledge skills can also be learned directly through the computer.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7767
   =GUID:665263244875575713
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Bills1
   =Value:Every Monday, Parafolks receive their household's bank statement through the mail panel.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7768
   =GUID:3912330537125019330
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Bills2
   =Value:Each bank statement lists electricity and water usage costs. Parafolks can also receive financial assistance, such as a family benefit for having children and paid work expenses.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7769
   =GUID:1532100039320327800
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Bills3
   =Value:To settle accounts, click here:
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7770
   =GUID:5542292416499407756
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Bills4
   =Value:Not paying bills will have your electricity and water services cut off until you settle all accounts.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7771
   =GUID:1814472086968730875
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_PickingStoryteller1
   =Value:When starting a new game, you'll be asked to select a <link=0>Storyteller</link>. Storytellers affect the difficulty level in <link=1>Live Mode</link>, and also offer unique <link=2>Together Cards</link> and nightly <link=3>Story Cards</link>.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7772
   =GUID:2591488951181642116
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_PickingStoryteller2
   =Value:The Storyteller can be changed at any time in the pause menu:
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7773
   =GUID:3181847956969174546
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_CustomStorytellers1
   =Value:Storytellers can be customized to adjust various gameplay parameters, such as the duration of life stages, the likelihood of fires, and salaries.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7774
   =GUID:2562081002160693874
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_StoryCards1
   =Value:Every night, the Storyteller offers you one Story Card, which can directly affect a Parafolk, give bonuses or new <link=0>life goals</link>, and more
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7775
   =GUID:4723619952636183892
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers_StoryCards2
   =Value:You can choose between a Story Card, or a themed book, which offers a new choice of Story Cards around that theme. Mouse over an option to see more details about it.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7776
   =GUID:8809575698127618093
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds1
   =Value:Playing with a Different Household
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7777
   =GUID:5622852220552198158
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds2
   =Value:At any time while playing in <link=0>Live Mode</link>, you can create a new household or switch to another existing one. You can switch back to the previous household at any time.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7778
   =GUID:3047137190585294204
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds3
   =Value:Click this button in the pause menu to create a new household in the same save file as the household you're currently playing.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7779
   =GUID:4752159289463213833
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds4
   =Value:To play another existing household, use the mouse wheel to zoom out and display the town map. Then, select a house owned by another household and click the “Switch to this Household” button.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7780
   =GUID:3689618509558123813
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds5
   =Value:Splitting a Household in Two
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7781
   =GUID:2644834698287913994
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds6
   =Value:A household can be split in two, with each part owning their own lot and house. A common use case is when children are ready to leave the nest and start to live on their own. At the moment, there is no way to merge two households into one.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7782
   =GUID:1326128023590828452
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds8
   =Value:Saving Households to the Library and Loading Them in Another Save File
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7783
   =GUID:5517551482113529424
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_ManagingHouseholds9
   =Value:Households can be saved to the Library to be shared on the Steam Workshop or loaded in another save file:
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7784
   =GUID:6648509588519480137
   =Key:Help_BuildMode1
   =Value:To enter Build Mode, click the button at the bottom left corner of the screen. Make sure you have purchased a lot first.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7785
   =GUID:3375885386758775704
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls1
   =Value:To place a wall, go into Build Mode and select the wall tool. Click on the terrain to start placing a wall, move your cursor to create a wall of the desired length, and click again to confirm placement.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7786
   =GUID:7406187495626122641
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls2
   =Value:Walls
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7787
   =GUID:8428040407485379497
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls4
   =Value:The grid can be disabled to allow free wall placement.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7788
   =GUID:6912678230185475340
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls5
   =Value:Curved Walls
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7789
   =GUID:8062655602869081062
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls6
   =Value:To place a curved wall, use the curved wall button.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7790
   =GUID:3917762054528245275
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls7
   =Value:Separator Walls
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7791
   =GUID:367722290969517239
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Walls8
   =Value:Separator walls are useful for splitting a room into two, and allow you to paint different sections of walls and floors separately.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7792
   =GUID:984669198641926036
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Objects1
   =Value:Items can be browsed by room or by product type:
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7793
   =GUID:3732439752011372076
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Objects3
   =Value:To place an item, select it in the catalog, move the cursor to where you want to put it, and click again to place it there.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7794
   =GUID:7400324195124437120
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Objects4
   =Value:To rotate the item before placing it, click and hold where you'd like it to go, and move the mouse to rotate it to the desired angle before releasing. Alternatively, while moving an item, press X to rotate it by 90 degrees.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7795
   =GUID:3630068845649985313
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Objects5
   =Value:Once placed, click an item to select it. You can then move the item again by clicking the move button, or by clicking the item a second time after it has been selected and moving your mouse. While moving, hold alt to disable item snapping.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7796
   =GUID:4193765051360312141
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Objects6
   =Value:Once an item is selected, you can customize its colors, delete it, or duplicate it. Some items support resizing or have variant options.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7797
   =GUID:2275080955338774299
   =Key:Help_Paramaker1
   =Value:Creating Parafolks
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7798
   =GUID:5322040630207211400
   =Key:Help_Paramaker2
   =Value:The Paramaker is the character creator in Paralives. It can be abbreviated as PAM.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7799
   =GUID:2601805617868621252
   =Key:Help_Paramaker3
   =Value:When starting a new game, you will be prompted to create a new household made of one or multiple Parafolks.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7800
   =GUID:6468185779288414245
   =Key:Help_Paramaker4
   =Value:Modifying Parafolks
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7801
   =GUID:3450762848267453787
   =Key:Help_Paramaker5
   =Value:After originally creating your Parafolks, you cannot change their <link=0>bodies</link> or <link=1>personalities</link>. However, you can click on a wardrobe to create and edit outfits. Visiting the hairdresser and tattoo shop will let you edit the corresponding parts of your Parafolks as well.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7802
   =GUID:5513966263734849440
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Body1
   =Value:When creating a new Parafolk, use the body and face presets to quickly get started.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7803
   =GUID:1372348860160008605
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Body2
   =Value:Then, use precise sliders to adjust fine details.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7804
   =GUID:2551303984189002021
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Outfit1
   =Value:Outfits can be created for various occasions. In Live Mode, Parafolks will automatically change outfits when they go to <link=0>work</link> or to sleep, for instance.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7805
   =GUID:7196104209889239135
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Outfit2
   =Value:Interact with a wardrobe or dresser item to create a new outfit. For each occasion, multiple outfits can be made.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7806
   =GUID:8828263691839912305
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Outfit3
   =Value:Some clothing items have customization options, like the ability to tuck in a shirt or pick the right top to go with a given jacket.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7807
   =GUID:4048954818605868717
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality1
   =Value:Stats
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7808
   =GUID:1923178298182570084
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality2
   =Value:Stat points give various bonuses to Parafolks, impacting their <link=0>needs</link>, <link=1>Together Cards</link>, and more.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7809
   =GUID:6711629587275071980
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality3
   =Value:Having 0 points in a given stat will cause negative effects.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7810
   =GUID:7267769010817203338
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality4
   =Value:Vibes
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7811
   =GUID:4295170462072206682
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality5
   =Value:Vibes impact how Parafolks see the world.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7812
   =GUID:104836196063314438
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality6
   =Value:Each Parafolk can have one Vibe.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7813
   =GUID:6375265214118794424
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality7
   =Value:Talents
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7814
   =GUID:1632144377234022788
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality8
   =Value:Talents impact the set of <link=0>skills</link> Parafolks excel in. They boost their learning speed in those skills as well as unlock unique <link=1>wants</link> and <link=2>Together Cards</link>.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7815
   =GUID:1560691902571372935
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality9
   =Value:Each Parafolk can have one Talent.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7816
   =GUID:157135904587020364
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality10
   =Value:Social Perks
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7817
   =GUID:4319549423706203458
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality11
   =Value:Social Perks impact how Parafolks act with each other. They unlock unique <link=0>Together Cards</link>.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7818
   =GUID:7783604786476424794
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality12
   =Value:Each Parafolk can have one Social Perk.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7819
   =GUID:8810727878021753308
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality13
   =Value:Lifestyles
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7820
   =GUID:6331023965088522726
   =Key:Help_Paramaker_Personality14
   =Value:Lifestyles are additional minor personality traits to further customize your Parafolks.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7821
   =GUID:8007545437908572540
   =Key:Help_Support1
   =Value:Hi, it's Alex, the lead developer behind Paralives!
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7822
   =GUID:6329798417180986478
   =Key:Help_Support2
   =Value:To report bugs as well as send comments or suggestions, click the button in the top right corner of the screen:
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7823
   =GUID:1661500629961944168
   =Key:Help_Support3
   =Value:We read all feedback we receive and use it to quickly fix the most critical bugs and improve the game based on your input.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7824
   =GUID:1175341790210344322
   =Key:Help_Support4
   =Value:You can also use this button to open the feedback form directly:
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7825
   =GUID:7498579109737281358
   =Key:Help_Support6
   =Value:Thank you for helping us improve Paralives!
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators
  i7826
   =GUID:7150061693517425357
   =Key:UIStorytellerSelection_Back
   =Value:Back
   =InfoForTranslators:When customizing the gameplay parameters of a Storyteller, there's a back button to exit the menu.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7827
   =GUID:4762251830985729713
   =Key:UITutorial_FirstStoryCard
   =Value:Every day, when your household is asleep, your Storyteller lets you pick a Story Card.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Tutotiral overlay shown after the first in-game day when the player must select a "story card"
  i7828
   =GUID:8755225264889055573
   =Key:StoryCardHand_TutorialHand
   =Value:You can choose one of three Story Cards each night. For our first night, let's pick a new life goal.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7829
   =GUID:4786755367291236181
   =Key:StatusEffectDescription_HungryChild
   =Value:This child needs food! If they stay hungry for too long, social services will intervene and take them away.
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you mouse over the "Hungry child" status effect, given to a kid-or-younger character that has a low hunger need
  i7830
   =GUID:8324231533084785046
   =Key:StatusEffect_LowHygieneAura
   =Value:Low Hygiene Aura
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators:Status given when the character has a low hygiene
  i7831
   =GUID:4523003730274948709
   =Key:StatusEffectDescription_LowHygieneAura
   =Value:Your hygiene is so low that you're giving off an unpleasant stink!
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you mouse over the "low hygiene aura" status, given to a character with a low hygiene need
  i7832
   =GUID:8185209734451754531
   =Key:UIGoals_GoalSharedBy
   =Value:Shared by:
   =LocalizationState:9
   =InfoForTranslators:Text  before the list of characters sharing a same goal
  i7833
   =GUID:3956003245013789570
   =Key:UIGoals_TooltipSharedGoal
   =Value:This goal is shared with other Parafolks, and all can contribute to completing it
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown as a tooltip on shared goals, shared goals use the progress of your whole household.
  i7834
   =GUID:8384291805627617491
   =Key:UIStoryCards_TutorialPickFirstStorycard
   =Value:You can choose one of three Story Cards every night. For our first night, let's pick a new life goal.
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Tutorial overlay shown when the player started to pick their first story card, guiding them to pick a "life goal"
  i7835
   =GUID:7641006520337672754
   =Key:UIGoalItem_CancelMessageSharedGoal
   =Value:Are you sure you want to cancel this goal?\nIt will be removed for all Parafolks sharing it.
   =InfoForTranslators:Popup asking the player if they are sure they want to cancel a goal that is shared between multiple characters
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7836
   =GUID:4591354202020982895
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Marquez
   =Value:All great towns need a great place to eat, and Sebastian is here to deliver. Alongside his son Eli, Sebastian's goal as the new chef in town is to open a fantastic restaurant for the residents. He's often seen outdoors, picking vegetables for recipe testing or hiking with his son. However, getting to know Sebastian may reveal hidden, unexpected secrets...
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Sebastian Marquez is a male Adult living with his adopted son Eli Marquez who is a male children
  i7837
   =GUID:1722687080358689120
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Nasser
   =Value:Anisa is quite well-known in town. Thanks to her job at the coffee shop, she knows everyone by name and manages to brighten everybody's day! During her time off, her fellow Townies can hear her playing guitar. Now that so many new folks are moving in, time will tell how Anisa, as well as the town, will adjust. What will she learn? Who will she meet?
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Anisa Nasser is a female Young Adult
  i7838
   =GUID:507623532778675771
   =Key:BrainLogic_TrainIntroTutorialWant
   =Value:Because you are inspired by the train ride
   =InfoForTranslators:Displays the reason why the character has an Inspired emotion
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7839
   =GUID:1104926646140290629
   =Key:UIMailbox_TutorialFirstBill
   =Value:Bills are sent weekly and have to be paid on time, otherwise your water and electricity might get shut off!
   =InfoForTranslators:Tutorial overlay when the player views their bills for the first time
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7840
   =GUID:6687687863284346657
   =Key:InteractionGroup_GROUP_Microwave
   =Value:Microwave
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7841
   =GUID:8239790217005880403
   =Key:InteractionGroup_GROUP_CallParafolk
   =Value:Call Parafolk...
   =InfoForTranslators:An interaction group that contains various interaction related to calling other parafolks on the phone for various reasons
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7842
   =GUID:1302178556120612411
   =Key:Interaction_CallParaInviteHome
   =Value:Invite home...
   =InfoForTranslators:When selecting that interaction, it opens a UI where you can select one or multiple characters to invite to come to your house
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7843
   =GUID:3682223989406250136
   =Key:UISelectCharacters_Header
   =Value:Select Parafolk(s)...
   =InfoForTranslators:Header of a window where the player can select one or more characters for multiple reasons (to invite them over the phone, for instance)
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7844
   =GUID:343832197992195373
   =Key:InteractionUsabilityRuleTooltip_NobodyToCall
   =Value:Need to know Parafolks in order to invite someone over.
   =InfoForTranslators:Error shown when trying to invite people home over the phone but you don't know anybody
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7845
   =GUID:3488614639070390382
   =Key:InteractionUsabilityRuleTooltip_CanOnlyInviteOnOwnLots
   =Value:Need to be home to invite over Parafolks.
   =InfoForTranslators:When calling parafolks to invite them to your home, this error will be displayed if you are not at home.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7846
   =GUID:3918074783140219399
   =Key:Notification_WelcomeWagon
   =Value:Hi! Welcome to the neighborhood!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you move in a new house and an NPC shows up to greet you
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7847
   =GUID:2104219477092929187
   =Key:Notification_ServiceClean
   =Value:Hi, this is the cleaning service! I'm here to make your house shine!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you call for the cleaning service, this NPC will clean around the house.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7848
   =GUID:3940564715716982957
   =Key:Notification_ServiceRepair
   =Value:Hi, repair service here! If anything is broken, I'll fix it!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you call for a repair person and they arrive at your house
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7849
   =GUID:8842102995725786000
   =Key:Notification_ServiceChildcare
   =Value:Hi, it's your friendly neighborhood childcare worker! I'm here to take care of the children!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you call for a childcare NPC, they will take care of your kids while you are away.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7850
   =GUID:1837442817730476837
   =Key:Notification_ServicePersonalAssistant
   =Value:Hi, personal assistant here! You've got tasks, I've got results!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you call to have a personal assistant come to your house. This NPC will clean, repair, and take care of your children
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7851
   =GUID:7810328822848566185
   =Key:Notification_ServicePizzaDelivery
   =Value:Here's your pizza! Thank you for ordering from La Tavola di Nonna!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when you call to order pizza and the delivery person arrives at your house. La Tavola di Nonna is the name of the italian restaurant in town and shouldn't be translated
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7852
