  i7985
   =GUID:5013985287638758674
   =Key:InteractionGroup_GROUP_TunnelEntrance
   =Value:Tunnel Entrance
   =InfoForTranslators:The item that corresponds to the entrace of a tunnel. It can be interacted with and acts as a fast travel to the other end of the tunnel
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7986
   =GUID:1469311095786162196
   =Key:Interaction_GoThroughTheTunnel
   =Value:Go through tunnel
   =InfoForTranslators:Characters can click on a tunnel's entrance and it acts as a fast travel (it teleports to the other ends)
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7987
   =GUID:3026066791896983016
   =Key:Help_Support5
   =Value:Send Feedback
   =InfoForTranslators:A button in the Help menu that a player can click to open the form on our website used to report bugs or send suggestions for the game
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7988
   =GUID:7073469239984086860
   =Key:Help_Welcome1
   =Value:Welcome to Paralives!
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7989
   =GUID:1891103101796949368
   =Key:Help_Welcome2
   =Value:This menu has resources and tips to help you support your Parafolks in their journey. It can be opened at any time while playing.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7990
   =GUID:5699372630404542786
   =Key:Help_Welcome
   =Value:Welcome
   =InfoForTranslators:The title of the first page of the help menu that the player sees when opening it. It's the home page of the help menu which contains many other pages about the live mode, build mode, etc
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7991
   =GUID:7038706092818389938
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships1
   =Value:To meet new Townies, walk around town, click on Parafolks, and select the Talk interaction.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7992
   =GUID:1573296554079740743
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Relationships2
   =Value:While together, Paras can <link=0>do any interactions as a group</link>. You can also pick <link=1>Together Cards</link> now and then to influence their conversations. <link=2>Relationship Labels</link> can be unlocked between two Parafolks, allowing you to define their relationship and the depth of their bond.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7993
   =GUID:3950400287455179558
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Occupations1
   =Value:Starting from the teen life stage, Parafolks can <link=0>find a job</link> and start their career. Younger Parafolks are automatically enrolled in <link=1>school</link>. Parafolks cannot be controlled while at their occupations.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7994
   =GUID:1824283755000868342
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Storytellers
   =Value:Storytellers
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7995
   =GUID:2710387738384129588
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town
   =Value:Town
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7996
   =GUID:1607689103255382044
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town_MuseumAndCollectibles
   =Value:Museum and Collectibles
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7997
   =GUID:5415929035435368843
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town_CommunityCenter
   =Value:Community Center
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i7998
   =GUID:1887194753856417991
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town1
   =Value:In Paralives, life stretches beyond your lot! Explore the town to meet Townies and visit parks, restaurants, shops, the museum, and more.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i7999
   =GUID:1814081760341977777
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town5
   =Value:When not on their lot, Parafolks can be sent home using the “Go home” interaction.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8000
   =GUID:8454705750923311245
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town_MuseumAndCollectibles1
   =Value:While exploring the town, you may stumble upon mushrooms, gems, and old buried artifacts.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8001
   =GUID:5914922634135384530
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town_MuseumAndCollectibles3
   =Value:To make a donation, click on one of the donation boxes at the museum and select the items you wish to donate.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8002
   =GUID:4715394533631385165
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town_CommunityCenter1
   =Value:Townies are working on building a community center from the ruins of a historical building. They're looking for donations to get the project started.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8003
   =GUID:5258324168580319516
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Town_CommunityCenter2
   =Value:To help the Community Center, interact with the books in the ruins to see what they need and to make donations.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8004
   =GUID:8410657332465659543
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers1
   =Value:Parafolks can start a family and have children, allowing generational gameplay. Babies and toddlers have different needs, so make sure to take care of them! When left alone at home, children under school age will automatically be sent to <link=0>daycare</link>, which will be charged to your next weekly <link=1>bank statement</link>.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8005
   =GUID:1390157504079563868
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_TryingForBaby1
   =Value:To try for a baby, your Parafolk will first need to gain a romantic interest in someone and become lovers with them. You will then be able to pick a <link=0>Together Card</link> to decide to be future parents.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8006
   =GUID:2454132792107045885
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_TryingForBaby2
   =Value:Once two Parafolks have decided to become parents, select them both, click on a bed, and pick the “Try for a baby” interaction.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8007
   =GUID:2167701801966185799
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_Pregnancy1
   =Value:In Paralives, pregnancy lasts 24 hours. After trying for a baby, it's possible to do a pregnancy test by clicking on a toilet. You can also visit the hospital to find out if you're expecting twins or triplets. Giving birth is done at home, and then you'll be able to pick a name for the little one!
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8008
   =GUID:5050704944393543145
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds1
   =Value:Hunger
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8009
   =GUID:4125042252465036506
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds2
   =Value:Babies can be breastfed or bottle-fed. Select a teen or adult Parafolk, then click on a baby to start the interaction and feed the baby.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8010
   =GUID:5738179815530348718
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds3
   =Value:Bathroom
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8011
   =GUID:8685627996583010509
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds4
   =Value:When this need gets too low, babies will automatically dirty their diaper. This will relieve their Bathroom need, but decrease their hygiene.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8012
   =GUID:8907503126165254033
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds5
   =Value:Hygiene
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8013
   =GUID:5220744322311183494
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds6
   =Value:Older Parafolks can pick up babies, place them in their crib, and then select the “Change diaper” interaction to raise their hygiene.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8014
   =GUID:5286920927044641279
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds7
   =Value:Sleep
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8015
   =GUID:2844296194045833962
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds8
   =Value:Babies automatically fall asleep when tired. However, they'll be more comfortable if an older Parafolk places them in their crib.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8016
   =GUID:8372730335595728111
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds9
   =Value:Affection
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8017
   =GUID:6345183429169789953
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_BabyNeeds10
   =Value:It's important to spend time and play with babies so they feel loved!
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8018
   =GUID:2004190389497665345
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds1
   =Value:Hunger
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8019
   =GUID:5592698788564235469
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds2
   =Value:To feed a toddler, have an older Parafolk pick them up and put them in a high chair. Then, select the toddler and click the high chair to eat.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8020
   =GUID:7053033140524402124
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds3
   =Value:Bathroom
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8021
   =GUID:3662675226246552533
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds4
   =Value:When this need gets too low, toddler Parafolks will automatically dirty their diaper. This will relieve their Bathroom need, but decrease their hygiene. Toddlers can also use the potty.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8022
   =GUID:3251872613574075427
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds5
   =Value:Hygiene
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8023
   =GUID:1155459101763924383
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds6
   =Value:To wash a toddler, pick them up and click on a bathtub before selecting the “Wash” interaction.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8024
   =GUID:2275100203910104998
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds7
   =Value:Sleep
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8025
   =GUID:3630554384062991751
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds8
   =Value:While babies sleep in a crib, toddlers sleep in small toddler beds. Make sure to purchase one!
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8026
   =GUID:6976560934713999001
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds9
   =Value:Affection
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8027
   =GUID:1688657321152577789
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers_ToddlerNeeds10
   =Value:It's important to spend time with toddlers for them to feel loved!
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8028
   =GUID:7941273728998006021
   =Key:Notification_ServiceBurglarLeave
   =Value:I'm not seeing anything of value... time to get out of here!
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when a burglar leaves your house (because there is nothing left to steal)
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8029
   =GUID:3397796680407608446
   =Key:Interaction_BuyDailyRecipe
   =Value:Learn a random new recipe
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown on a book in the general store where you can buy/learn a random new cooking recipe daily
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8030
   =GUID:3667941332364129950
   =Key:InteractionUsabilityRuleTooltip_NoMoreRecipesToday
   =Value:No more recipes available today. Check back tomorrow.
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown when a character already learned a recipe from the big book of recipes and tries again.
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8031
   =GUID:5036575132277251704
   =Key:InteractionGroup_GROUP_RecipeBook
   =Value:Recipe Book
   =InfoForTranslators:A book that players can click to do interactions like learning a cooking recipe
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8032
   =GUID:8765755378840325587
   =Key:InteractionUsabilityRuleTooltip_AllRecipesKnown
   =Value:No new recipes to learn.
   =InfoForTranslators:Shown on the recipe book when the character knows all cooking recipes
   =LocalizationState:13
  i8033
   =GUID:8701702085702963989
   =Key:Interaction_KickSomethingAngrily
   =Value:Kick
   =InfoForTranslators:When characters have the angry emotion, it's possible to do the Kick interaction on various things like trash cans to release some steam
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8034
   =GUID:8627973980200350034
   =Key:Interaction_FlexMuscle
   =Value:Flex muscles
   =InfoForTranslators:Interaction that a character can do in front of the muscle to contemplate and appreciate their own arm muscles
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8035
   =GUID:5986192781848182641
   =Key:Item_ShopOdditiesWallEar
   =Value:Oditi
   =InfoForTranslators:Do not translate (except chinese localization)
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8036
   =GUID:6045399544355657444
