   =GUID:4077810303669583962
   =Key:HouseholdBio_Gervais
   =Value:Julien is good at his job... maybe a little too good. It's all he thinks about! He considers his ambition and perfectionistic tendencies to be his greatest qualities. His compulsive need to be the best is fed by his relationship with his corporate rival, Samantha, in an epic battle of professional passive aggressiveness. However, he'll never admit the pang of loneliness he feels when he's out of the office... Maybe there's more to life than overhead fluorescent lighting and cubicle walls?
   =LocalizationState:13
   =InfoForTranslators:Julien Gervais is a male Young Adult
  i8249
   =GUID:8053359390445397021
