   =InfoForTranslators: Word play with "Stone" and "Tony". This decorative item is a rock with a face painted on it. It's a smily face with googly eyes and a little cowboy hat. You can find a funny name in your language or go with a cute first name that fits this rock.
   =LocalizationState:9
  i8260
   =GUID:8114485848232007947
   =Key:Item_TreasurePetRockPrincess
   =Value:Enroque
   =InfoForTranslators: Word play with "Rock" and the first name "Enrique". This decorative item is a rock with a face painted on it. It looks like the face of a prince with googly eyes and a crown and he has lipstick marks on his cheeks. You can find a funny name in your language or go with a cute first name that fits this rock.
