  i8351
   =GUID:5124513231470308645
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_BabiesAndToddlers2
   =Value:Parafolks can either <link=0>get pregnant</link> or adopt a baby by visiting the hospital.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:8
  i8352
   =GUID:9115916257620235354
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Inventory
   =Value:Inventory
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:8
  i8353
   =GUID:3465077486521059172
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Inventory1
   =Value:While in Build Mode, all items on your lot can be stored in your inventory. This is useful if you want to keep furniture, food, or other kinds of items for later use.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:12
  i8354
   =GUID:2386688293519888412
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Inventory2
   =Value:To add an item to your inventory, go into Build Mode, click on the item, and click the “Add to Inventory” button.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:12
  i8355
   =GUID:5164243928191857611
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Inventory5
   =Value:Make sure the items are in your inventory, then talk to the Townie and turn in the request by clicking on the appropriate <link=0>Together Card</link>.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:12
  i8356
   =GUID:5723704707593829340
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Inventory4
   =Value:Some <link=0>goals</link> require you to have specific items in your inventory in order to give them to the Townie who gave you the <link=1>request</link>.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:12
  i8357
   =GUID:2467266904123353872
   =Key:Help_BuildMode_Inventory3
   =Value:In <link=0>Live Mode</link>, you can open your inventory to see your list of stored items. Clicking on an item gives you the option to sell it or place it on your lot.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:12
  i8358
   =GUID:6012691413129982310
   =Key:Help_LiveMode_Goals_Requests4
   =Value:If a Townie asks you to bring them specific items, be sure to <link=0>add the items to your inventory</link> before turning in the request.
   =InfoForTranslators
   =LocalizationState:12
  i8359
   =GUID:8556527631263126881
